        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*She looks up from the fire, recognises you, and does not get up.* Back already. It has not cost you anything yet, then -- you would be walking differently.\n\nThere is no exercise I can set you for this part. Go and be a sorcerer in front of people until it costs you something. Eight levels deeper into the blood than you are now, near enough, and you will have paid something you did not agree to. Come back to me then.\n\nI will still be here. The lake is slow."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 2,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
