        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*She hands the staff over and steps back to look at you holding it, head on one side.* That is the first part done. There is more -- the speech that dragons answer to, the sceptre they drowned with Armenelos, the unbinding -- and none of it is mine to give you today.\n\nGo and be an inconvenience to somebody. You are very well suited to it."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 6,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
