        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*She stands up, puts a hand flat on your breastbone, and says your name and one other word in Adunaic, quite quietly, the way you would read a label.* There. That is what you are. It is not a sentence and it is not a gift, it is a fact about you, like your height.\n\n*She works a plain grey ring off her own hand and drops it into yours.* Not an heirloom. I keep a box of them. It only means somebody knew and did not run.\n\nGo and be eight levels deeper into it than you are, and I will still be here. The lake is slow."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 8,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
